cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "IonosphericScintillation: Signal Processing and Time-Frequency Analysis Suite for URAN-4 Data"
abstract: "A scientific analysis software for URAN-4 radio telescope observations, providing multitaper power spectral density estimation, Thomson F-test harmonic detection, weighted linear phase slope velocity regression, coherence gating, and continuous/synchrosqueezed wavelet spectrograms."
version: 1.0.1
date-released: 2026-09-03
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/DanielZhicool/IonosphericScintillation"
keywords:
  - ionospheric scintillation
  - radio astronomy
  - URAN-4
  - multitaper spectral estimation
  - time-frequency analysis
  - wavelet transform
  - solar wind velocity
authors:
  - family-names: "Zhykul"
    given-names: "Danylo"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-8023-2839" 
